{"title":"uStudy 后端架构报告（2026-03-27）","uid":"49dab94abc3bba1896064849afca8cc5","slug":"2026-03-27-backend-architecture-report","date":"2026-03-27T04:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-03-27T04:00:00.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-03-27-backend-architecture-report.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"content":"<h1>uStudy 后端架构</h1>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"1-系统全景\">1. 系统全景</h2>\n<p>uStudy 后端是一个面向 AI 辅助学习场景的 FastAPI 单体服务，通过 SSE 流式传输向客户端推送 LLM 响应，并围绕知识图谱、向量记忆、间隔复习三条主线组织核心业务。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml/svg/RLHTInj157tVNp6aBvOIAc9BaL9CWbfBqiQaZq8PizDro7wnEwl4KYY22cg9eSKgnOOeKkb7OcbjeQajzBTaD-PVzCxCJWoDoKFct7lEdfcvPpFfC-onm39Hzskxsww7QoVHValpozHsiOSjj81BPSDp0blFEARZeMlJAVuTO9GSotLiOhCYgvW4UQJ4i6sOHDDmYO4YqNtV3ZTFkXzRw2QwVslU7WbiciIkUps1i8yo9WLjdzjiT7VMmzgUwALqYzgQrdyaIWH55kWLb8PT4Lk7PqrZdwNoi-Zl3tGRBJjUcNW-FFYPXk3JtnfAS4uMLuW7ch5n12TYaibjyhD3z80joXuiSlztCukOeP5YSIe-0i0XJig07n_Smb-hqUVZJXikeH7xYTQGOiR3xY88klNZYzPw-FRtnUaNAH2T8NuXDGFiQ7SZQXn5Ho-wtmub6-f3t1on7A_2TxDJwsrKBvgduPzrIOVM47qke2ihn8U15SWI9SlSvsohzs6RttCnbnoJKawxGkim3CeyhbXG06blxMNly81BezUjJdjFYjDNQ1ywZ3wb9SoeO_ExSuqdDYzLf4IqSzfpJTCnmmlOXqJa7PyP7YdEPUVj6yWrbWXFag3dPmPu1Q9JNzuFNsbQoNG27IKUkSGkY3Jm781dDflZMvso5eYkKzkGrb1LYiTEkUAWj4TrWm1_uixedL7KQHz1SEEJYPQYfqpgOdxryl1Xyo1EWQWhLe7uCj2zrMQd_LrIfYnCJSN8U7ZP74_DmjK-e3RcGJclzHfdqUQhiBeR9v5pD4s-KoYPl2UoBLwZImHlWbYBP2iaCzplnGbLE0wWWY9X2eZyA20JeL1w4CJ3quIJgC1yOYC5fOz2t4QjkOjQ2nC5qWDhQQ7GW9CS-Q0Pd-TbdwE-6mTzEmvu8kuca_5SqGGAjt-6zNfOVTFRtubE6k6xhOlpJs6rThcPUBZYZaL1ZhBl4Gzg4cOEVxx_0000\" alt=\"PlantUML 架构图\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"2-模块总览\">2. 模块总览</h2>\n<p>后端共 40+ 个功能模块，按职责分为六个域：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml/svg/TLLjRzfM5FxEhx2op_koNz2eMwLEgZebdVO5ANAC0rR1TcsJYawJmfeGHiDB5W8aRSfB8MKl6BebSGAXIFmMtslxN-pSUu42PlW3jk_pt7FFSvvp_40tUCs8nw8SRjVHHHbLgoZzEqgd0lfpILPvZOznAYyyvyFYff68Yfmc2WOlXwFY760R065DYSkXXqfKqRYl7gsJAn2OCBarj_-NFHYwPjFj9Y746lTpW8EVeCHKHHPbWrlZuqOaAED_soXrDBQSim4QdewjTLMDYcFh-v-UZItKJJcrf7UOTORc6iVh7A7ujX4CQPSt94M6pKPx-6e077HmZB