://www.plantuml.com/plantuml/svg/ZLFVJzDG57xlNt62Bss035Hy89bXaWWF9aw7pykblTjkwDhbzg91OmA4X0v6N9GvZ1W8JYKO61Xmn0d-CzpRxib_mTiV48QOs3xrdFDzv_lEEHrn6A9ikcY2lzVmctFYQCxRNbQSAMAL44L5c4JwL9xQqvOnQfisXHltKy6ho2mZEYaXYy6eIR35ka8zQ9eL4XB7CEq1v41AVYi6OcWIEHZIjiFo56SUFGXowJ55IIR1UzVc9pL89fM84FhlXZ0OXlJ3p0GaK8aaGbxJpXCBL5n4n8HUA277UMPJGrF2SWbBZqcGsFZaDxUyrMtXjdx_h7HsAj8WJEfqfiI0lt7vSQKRmDttlFq37kCSnKvXmfx2iabcFDL_S-WEyDqrFh_T1pbK9EPCbbnqa-XOxp2y0AJhs76oB08F3XM9fVK1ZIZFmxS630rUXgRFsWslNE5kIxpT_n_hCHEeNPH_EnVbKmXJsG9o2jA--3Whmx5y46jDNltCMz_4wqPdTLP19elAGQoNHSrLG3xTdFKlvnMRY_xUVWIKnD7K0lcnErwjn6sqIpINnnGKTmsgDmnrMLAmAGybIakT_jRNpkAAN2QeWPEZPUxkyqOGqAxH6ceJjSEpuvqBn-LPQIqY_8UismE3yCGAncnJyXmR2hQCQ4c_FeYbXjzgUgi7roxfhDqM2w_yPaiSp8Dw3oEAALpPJ5ngODqsSEHHrI2-ol5CS6FUxYclhiXfI7DYVKFKltVgXrTkT6dJFpc9ZbeMvZ7BubmEwumybQG4KrLJHgHk-Kl_0G00\" alt=\"PlantUML 架构图\"></p>\n<p><strong>设备限制</strong>：每用户最多 N 个并发设备（默认可配），超出时最旧令牌自动失效。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"8-异步-Agent-任务模式\">8. 异步 Agent 任务模式</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml/svg/RPFFRjD04CRl-nIZSad57wCUAu4QDMbKARYcBJUaQ6kl8YkfRNdNXoggH8ieRGg40q909225AZcL826ane6doThcr5TWrZ6bLcCVREzytynlPxnBN51V1DjDADQP8s0IXhBTYmOzEUuGth0TZ_fq6xQesQZxRk1OosxJzU76Ib7T1AF2DcsFedMvQME6tD8SLKcvXax1_3cW7DRJLs9HGRSePs2uNDHzjl6mgg969UzFeJOfRpnsvEjNiZEKBplnu3ZDf9RpwchrGHh19o5J7BXzFoi9Ys2iRMo2HZrRoxW4fk1QI-nuR9TaCZGO5HJBmwuCHt1900LibGZuFQEibrRrolmLmsK5odSSqtRlc3wZWjLK_e8VEBMqNc7-lmTD6U0YBDnTWA9fCaym2rgWJ3NRWbr2cgxhmNJZqL4_wRqWW5TAymypwlw8tWuXOrj_fEl8bfDXDzHsldv8Vfsb7ydmQVncS34-JFe7qtd7tqFvyVXYV7GzlpnuBv-TJaPz-NoaBEtzUFzSItwVQtzEtiNTCsqIVea_xytqvjbAQtePD5WfhbRB9S8SQ-QCAkNP8vesvTgKea-doRUJArEAsp-Z9tjm4r3d1QAcVhIPNMzbNBSo9VPx2Q7mAFm5\" alt=\"PlantUML 架构图\"></p>\n<p><strong>任务类型</strong>：<code>GENERATE_KNOWLEDGE_GRAPH</code>、<code>GENERATE_QUIZ</code>、<code>EXPAND_NODE</code>、<code>GENERATE_ARTIFACT</code>、<code>GENERATE_KNOWLEDGE_GRAPH_FROM_DOCUMENTS</code>、<code>GENERATE_REVIEW_QUIZ</code>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"9-RAG-文档处理管线\">9. RAG 文档处理管线</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https